{"id":"curiosidad","lemma":"curiosidad","pos":"noun","rank":1617,"glosses":["curiosity"],"ipa":"/kuɾjosiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"curiosidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-curiosidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Por qué tenías tanta curiosidad?","en":"Why were you so curious?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152570","words":[null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"copy","l":"tanto"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"why, for what reason"]]},{"text":"Solo tengo curiosidad.","en":"I'm just curious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77105","words":[{"g":"sole"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null]},{"text":"La curiosidad mató al gato.","en":"Curiosity killed the cat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537847","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to kill, slay","l":"matar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"cat"}]},{"text":"Lo hice por curiosidad.","en":"I did it out of curiosity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78712","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Eso me da curiosidad.","en":"This makes me curious.","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null]}]}